TypeRelay is a self-hosted, open-source relay service that lets you
use your own messaging apps (WhatsApp, Telegram, Signal, etc.) from a
unified web interface.

This port installs the server component (apps/server) only: an Express-based
Node.js/TypeScript application that provides the web app and API backed by
MongoDB, plus memcached for caching.

It excludes the Rust TUI/expand engine, the Tauri desktop app, the MCP
adapter, and mobile components.

WWW: https://typerelay.com
